{"availability":"available","full":"ColorlibHQ/Travelify","name":"Travelify","description":"Free responsive WordPress travel and blogging theme — full-width featured post slider, left/right sidebar layouts, WooCommerce ready and a jQuery-free front end.","category":"Design","language":"PHP","stars":71,"forks":64,"created":"2014-05-14T08:44:58Z","updated":"2026-09-16T19:11:59Z","license":"GPL-2.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://colorlib.com/wp/themes/travelify/","topics":["blog-theme","colorlib","free-wordpress-theme","gpl","php","responsive-design","theme","travel-theme","woocommerce","wordpress","wordpress-customizer","wordpress-theme"],"demo":"https://colorlibhub.com/travelify/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T16:12:51.915Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T16:12:51.915Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T16:12:51.915Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:33:28.161Z","stars":71,"forks":64},{"at":"2026-10-04T16:12:51.915Z","stars":71,"forks":64}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Live demo · Download from WordPress.org · Documentation · Support forum","Travelify is a clean, responsive travel and blogging theme that looks good on any screen. It ships a full-width featured post slider, a widgetised left or right sidebar you can set globally or per post, footer widgets, social icons and Customizer options for colours, header and footer with live preview.","The theme's own JavaScript runs without jQuery, the Ubuntu webfont is bundled rather than fetched from a third party, and the front end is built on HTML5 with block editor styles. Travelify is WooCommerce ready, SEO friendly, translation ready and comes with nineteen bundled translations (English, French, German, Hungarian, Italian, Spanish, Dutch, Hebrew, Slovak, Turkish, Swedish, Brazilian Portuguese, Polish, Finnish, Bulgarian, Greek, Persian, Russian and Chinese). It also plays nicely with Breadcrumb NavXT, WP-PageNavi, Contact Form 7 and WPML."],"fe